SUMMARY:Kiwanis Halloween Free Trick or Treat for all ages at Ives Park
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for our third annual Halloween at Ives Park this Halloween eve! The park will be transformed with AstroBotanicals (inflated\, illuminated sculptures) to set the mood\, plus music\, candy\, community spirit\, a pumpkin Fairy Godmother\, and even adult beverages for a bit of extra cheer. \nTime is 4-8pm (rain cancels) \nWant to host your own trick or treat booth? There is plenty of room. RSVP at:sponsors@sebastopolkiwanisclub.org \nThis party in Ives Park is a perfect place for everyone to gather\, relax\, and represent themselves\, their families or organizations in the heart of the Halloween fun. It is an event for all ages. Remember the joke contest and booth? The kids sure do. Come out for the fun! \nNew this year; Scarecrow contest. Come dressed up as a scarecrow\, or make scarecrows at the event.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/kiwanis-halloween-free-trick-or-treat-for-all-ages-at-ives-park/
LOCATION:CA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-Kiwanis-Halloween-free-costume-party-3.png
END:VEVENT
