SUMMARY:An Evening of Poetry: Tim Hunt in Conversation with Pat Nolan
DESCRIPTION:Tim Hunt and Pat Nolan are both American poets\, authors\, and literary figures associated with independent publishing\, mid-century literary scholarship\, and the West Coast poetry scene. \nThey share a distinct connection through their work on American literature—particularly the Beat Generation—and have actively supported each other’s literary endeavors. \n– Light refreshments\, including Pax Wines\, and fantastic poetry served in equal measure \n– Beautiful letterpress broadsides of poets’ work available with a donation to NBLA \nPlease join us!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/an-evening-of-poetry-tim-hunt-in-conversation-with-pat-nolan/
