SUMMARY:Raise the Steaks "Fund-grazer"
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we “Raise the Steaks!” \nOn November 7\, 2026\, the Sebastopol Community Cultural Center invites you to join us for our biggest fundraising event of the year! \nThis event will help the Community Center raise crucial funds to support our services including concerts\, events\, classes\, youth programs\, arts education\, community facility rentals\, and operations. \nThis special evening will include: \n“All-You-Can-Eat” dinner with a steak or vegetarian (portobello mushroom) option\, plus a baked potato bar\, salad\, baked beans\, bread\, and dessert!\nSilent Auction\nA fun Wine Pull with the opportunity to walk away with a fantastic bottle of wine!\nLive DJ\nBeer\, wine\, specialty drink\, and non-alcoholic beverages\n✨ TIME: 5 p.m. Doors\, 6 – 8:30 p.m. Dinner\n✨ PLACE: Sebastopol Community Cultural Center\, 390 Morris St\, Sebastopol \n✨ TICKET: $125
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/raise-the-steaks-fund-grazer/
