SUMMARY:STIMULANT | Art Exhibition and Events
DESCRIPTION:Apocalypse Studio\, Sebastopol’s multidisciplinary father-and-daughter artist duo\, presents STIMULANT: Art as Remedy for Diseased Culture\, a two-week exhibition of large-scale paintings and digital works at Laguna Lab\, November 7–20\, 2026. The show opens Saturday\, November 7 at 7.30 PM with a spoken word performance featuring the exhibition’s centerpiece\, a 144 piece mosaic – The Oversoul. \nSTIMULANT argues that only culture can rebalance our dysfunctional systems of money and power. The exhibition explores the inner and outer work of co-creating that new culture: art\, ideas\, and dialogue that stimulates new possibilities and activates action. \nOver two weeks the exhibition comes alive through two live performances\, two artist lectures\, a salon\, and six afternoons to meet the artists for conversation and walkthroughs.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/stimulant-art-exhibition-and-events/
LOCATION:Laguna Lab\, 117 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults, generally
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/STIMULANT-POSTER.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Apocalypse Studio":MAILTO:song@apocalypse.art
END:VEVENT
